## F. Abstract (Bahasa Inggris)

- **Wajib** — bukan opsional. Pedoman ITB mensyaratkan kedua versi.
- Bukan terjemahan kaku Google Translate. Kalimat boleh disusun ulang
  agar enak dibaca dalam bahasa Inggris.
- Panjang sebanding dengan Abstrak ID (jangan jauh lebih pendek/panjang).
- Istilah teknis: pakai istilah Inggris standar (Remaining Useful Life,
  rolling bearing, Sparse Autoencoder).
- Periksa konsistensi angka dan klaim — RMSE 13% di ID = RMSE 13% di EN.

```latex
\chapter*{ABSTRACT}
\label{abs:en}
\addcontentsline{toc}{chapter}{ABSTRACT}

\noindent
\textbf{REMAINING USEFUL LIFE PREDICTION OF ROLLING BEARINGS USING
A MAMBA-xLSTM HYBRID ARCHITECTURE WITH SPARSE AUTOENCODER
INTERPRETABILITY}\\[6pt]
\textbf{By}\\
\textbf{\@author}\\
\textbf{NIM: \@nim}\\
\textbf{(\@prodi{} Doctoral Program)}\\[12pt]

Remaining Useful Life (RUL) prediction for rolling bearings underpins
modern predictive maintenance, yet state-of-the-art Transformer- and
LSTM-based methods still face a trade-off between long-sequence
accuracy, computational cost, and interpretability. \dots

\vspace{0.5cm}
\noindent
\textbf{Keywords:} remaining useful life, rolling bearing, Mamba,
xLSTM, sparse autoencoder, interpretability, predictive maintenance
```

